# An audit's raw output is an artifact, not a build product: every number reported from one is
# checked against the log beside it. Named against `*.log` above, which would otherwise take it.
!paper/audit/**/*.log

# The CORE-Bench run's console output is an artifact, not a build product.
!evaluation/recall.log

# Lock sidecars hold nothing.
*.provenance-lock

# Other projects' web pages and publishers' PDFs that quotations are pinned to. Not redistributed.
paper/prior_art/sources/
paper/prior_art/reference/
